comment.body:
Thanks for the report. I reviewed the attached bundle, but the current issue text still does not tell us whether the failure happens when opening PowerToys, launching Crop and Lock, starting OCR, or using one specific Crop and Lock mode. Could you please provide:
1. the exact action that crashes (double-click tray icon, use the Crop and Lock hotkey, choose Reparent/Thumbnail, or start OCR);
2. whether PowerToys exits entirely or only the Crop and Lock / OCR window closes;
3. the newest Application Error entry from Event Viewer for PowerToys, CropAndLock, or OCR.exe if Windows logged one; and
4. a fresh diagnostic bundle captured immediately after reproduction by commenting /bugreport on the issue and attaching the ZIP (or by running BugReportTool.exe from the install folder if PowerToys exits too quickly).
That will tell us which component is actually crashing.
